  "problem": "A region $D$ is **connected** if every pair of points in $D$ can be joined by a smooth curve or a path that lies entirely in $D.$\n\nThe region below is connected because a smooth path can join any two points.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14163649/assets/90fea89e0dabec960edf7eef3552e10cdbccaee80f9ef6ca3d5b2a5b457e6b89.png)\n\nThe region below is not connected. If we take two points $P$ and $Q,$ one in each subregion, we cannot find a path joining these points that lies entirely in the region.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14163649/assets/08cd555c38106ec22f2ffe4808a6b62e8f72ffda7baf953836beeca5ee6a1faf.png)",
